<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Chiyubunuzyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibbuku LyaChiyubunuzyo Chakapegwa Joni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Chiyubunuzyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Chiy</para>
  <para style="mt1">CHIYUBUNUZYO</para>
  <para style="mt3">chaJoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibbuku eeli lyaChiyubunuzyo ndibbuku lyakumamanino amabbuku woonse ali muChizuminano Chipya. Alimwi kubanga lyakalembwa kumamanino muminyaka yamakkumi alimusanu amakkumi aane alaminyaka ilimusanu Kkirisitu kaali wazyalwa, amutumwa Joni (Chiyubunuzyo 1:1). Nguwe lubo wakalemba ibbuku lyaMakani Mabotu aJoni amagwalo aatatu aJoni mutaanzi, aJoni wachibili, aJoni wachitatu. Joni wakalizibikene mbuli umwi “Ooyo Jesu ngwakali kuyanda” (Joni 13:23). Wakalemba bbuku lyaChiyubunuzyo kali akasuwa kaPatimosi nkaambo wakali mubwaange nkaambo kakukambawuka Makani Mabotu aJesu Kkirisitu (Chiyubunuzyo 1:9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Makanze aJoni kukulemba ibbuku lyaChiyumbunuzyo wakali kusungwaazya babala kuti bachaale kabasyomekede kuli Jesu Kkirisitu akubapa bulangizi nkaambo chindi chakuboola kwaJesu chaba afwiifwi (Chiyubunuzyo 1:3, 22:7). Wakalembela banaKkirisitu boonse ambungano zyakasalidwe zilimusanu azibili zilimuchaandano cha (Chiyubunuzyo 2:1—3:22). Joni ulyaamba kuti ooku kulemba nkwabusinsimi (Chiyubunuzyo 1:3) ulibikkide zikozyanisyo zyiingi mubbuku eeli lyoonse mukupandulula zintu nzyakabona. Ibbuku eeli lilikozyene azibalo zimwi zili muChizuminano Chakale, kapati loko zilimbuli Zakkariya (Zakkariya 6:1-8). Myeembo ilimusanu ayibili andido zilimusanu azibili alazyo zilikozyene azyuumo zyaLeza nzyakapa Ijiputi kuti zibe zisubulo (Kulonga 7:1—9:35). Chiyubunuzyo chaambuula atala amamanino achiindi, kuti Jesu nguyooba muzundi, alimwi ababo babikka lusyomo lwabo mulinguwe bayopona kwalyoonse anguwe. Ibbuku eeli ngalimuchenjezye akumupa bulangilizi bwakuti Jesu ulaboola akufwambaana.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Joni utalika akulyaamba kuti we ngwani akuti wakatambula biyeni chiyubunuzyo eechi chabusinsimi (Chiyubunuzyo 1:1-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Upa makani aakwe kazwa kuliJesu kuya kumbungano zilimusanu azibili (Chiyubunuzyo 1:1—3:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo upandulula zisinizyo zilimusanu azibili (Chiyubunuzyo 4:1—8:5) amyeembo ilimusanu ayibili (Chiyubunuzyo 8:6—11:19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuzwa aawo Joni upandulula nkondo yamwana mulombe asimwaaba ujisi mitwe ilimusanu ayibili. (Chiyubunuzyo 12:1—14:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo ulemba atala andido zyabukali zilimusanu azibili (Chiyubunuzyo 15:1—16:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela Joni upandulula Leza mbwazunda basinkondonyina kujulu (Chiyubunuzyo 17:1—20:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kumamanino upandulula atala ajulu pya anyika impya iyooza kumamanino (Chiyubunuzyo 21:1—22:21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Chiyubunuzyo chaJesu Kkirisitu, eecho Leza nchakamupa kuti atondeezye balanda bakwe eezyo ziya kukuyoochitika achakufwambana. Alimwi wakachichita kuti chizibikane akutuma mungelo kumulanda wakwe Joni, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />ooyo upa bukamboni kujwi lyaLeza abukamboni bwaJesu Kkirisitu, nikuba kuli zyoonse nzyaakabona. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Ulaachoolwe ooyo ubala majwi abusinsimi, alimwi balaachoolwe aabo balimvwa akuchita, zintu eezyo zilembedwe mumo, nkaambo chiindi chaba afwiifwi.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujuzigwa Kwambungano Zilimusanu Azibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kul 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:5">Chiy 4:5</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ime ndiJoni ndilikulemba lugwalo kumbungano zilimusanu azibili zilimuchilikiti chaEziya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Akube luzyalo aluumuno kulindinywe oolo luzwa kuliLeza ooyo upona kalyoonse wakaliwo awuchiza, alimwi kuzwa kumyuuya ilimusanu ayibili ilikunembo lyachuuno chakwe chabulemu, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:4">Ay 55:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:27">Int 89:27</ref>.</char></note>alimwi kuzwa kuliJesu Kkirisitu kalikamboni usyomekede, mubele wabubuke kuzwa kubafu, alimwi mweendelezi wabaami banyika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Kulinguwe ooyo wakatuyanda alimwi wakatwangununa kuzwa kuzibi zyesu mukwiinda mubulowa bwakwe <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />akutuchita kuti tube bantu babwami, abapayizi kuliLeza wakwe aWisi, kulinguwe akube bulemu abweendelezi kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Laanga, ulaza mumayooba, alimwi bantu boonse bayoomubona, abaabo boonse bakamuyasa, mikowa yoonse yamunyika iyoolila kapati nkaambo kakwe. Iyii mbukuyooba. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 22:13">Chiy 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kul 3:14</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Ndiindime Alufa aOmega,” Mbwaamba Mwami Leza Singuzu Zyoonse, nguunguwe uliwo awakaliwo awuchiyoobuza.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilengano ChaKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ime, Joni, musyominyokwe asimulimunyokwe, waabilana andinywe muliJesu mumapenzi, amubwami, amulukakatilo, ndakabikkwa akasuwa kategwa Patimosi nkaambo kajwi lizwa kuliLeza abukamboni bwaJesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ndakali muMuuya mubuzuba kwaMwami, mpawo ndakamvwa kusule lyangu ijwi pati mbuli mweembo <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />alimwi lyakati, “Lemba eezyo nzuliikubona mubbuku mpawo ulitumizye kumbungano zilimusanu azibili kuEfesu akuSimuna akuPegamamu akuTiyatira akuSadisi akuFiladelufiya akuLayodisiya.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Eelyo ndakacheba kuti ndilange wakali kwaambuula andime, mukucheba kwangu ndakabona zibikilo zyazimunikisyo zyangolide zilimusanu azibili, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13.</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5">Dan 10:5</ref>.</char></note>mpawo akati kazibikilo zyazimunikisyo eezyo kwakali umwi uli mbuli mwana mulombe wamuntu, wakali samide mudabba mulamfu kaangide wamwiingwa nkwa angolide akaango kakwe. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref>.</char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14,15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10:6</ref>.</char></note> Isusu lyakumutwe wakwe lyakali kutuba mbuli buluba, akutuba mbuli chivula mabwe; meso aakwe akali mbuli mabangabanga amulilo, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />alimwi mawulu aakwe akali mbuli chibulo chamukuba, chawumpwa mumvuto yamulilo, ajwi lyakwe lyakali mbuli kuvuuma kwameenda mayiingi, <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />kuluboko lwakwe lwakululyo wakalijisi inyenyezi zilimusanu azibili, mpawo kumulomo wakwe kwakazwa ipanga libosya koonsekoonse, abusyu bwakwe bwakali kumweka mbuli izuba nilimwekesya anguzu. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Nindakamubona, ndakawida kumawulu aakwe ndabaanga ndafwa. Pesi wakabikka luboko lwakwe lwakululyo alindime, kati, “Utayoowi, ndime mutaanzi amuchalizi, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />alimwi ndilapona, ndakalindafwa, pesi laanga ndimuumi kwalyoonse alyoonse, ndijisi zijuzyo zyalufu azyachikkalilo chabafu. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Aboobo lemba atala azintu nzubwene, azeezyo ziliwo lino azeezyo ziyoochitika kunembo. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Mboobu bupanduluzi bwansiswa bwanyenyeezi zilimusanu azibili nzubwene muluboko lwangu lwakululyo, azibikilo zyazimunikisyo zyangolide zilimusanu azibili, inyenyeezi zilimusanu azibili mbangelo bayiimikilila mbungano zilimusanu azibili azibikkilo zyamalampi zilimusanu azibili zyiimikilila mbungano zilimusanu azibili.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Majwi Aaya kumbungano YakuEfeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Kumungelo wambungano yaku Efesu lemba oobu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">“Ngaaya majwi ayooyo ujisi nyenyezi zilimusanu azibili muluboko lwakwe lwakululyo, ooyo weenda akati kazibikilo zyazimunikisyo zilimusanu azibili zyangolide. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />“ ‘Ndilizi milimu yako, akubela changuzu kwako kwakukakatila kwako. Anzila njutakonzyi kubotelwa babi pesi wakasunka aabo balyaamba kuti mbatumwa, pesi kabatali mbabo pe, akuziba kuti mbabeji. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ndilizi kuti ulatobelezya akukakatila mumapenzi nkaambo kangu alimwi taakwe numaana nguzu pe. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Pesi ndijisi eechi atala anduwe, kuti wakaleka luyando lwako ndwaakali aalo lutaanzi pe. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Eelyo yeeya kuzwa mpuwakawida, sanduka mpawo uchite milimu yako njuwakali kuchita lutaanzi. Kuti teewatasanduka, ndizooza kulinduwe ndikagwisye chibikilo chachimwinikisyo chako kuzwa kubusena bwacho. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Kakuli kuti ujisi chintu chibotu eechi, ulisulide milimo mibi yabaNikkolayiti, eeyo njindisulide ambebo.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“Kufumbwa ujisi matwi, ngamvwe Muuya nchuwaamba kumbungano!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">“Kuli kufumbwa uzunda ndiyoomupa kuti akalye kumusamu wabuumi, uli muparadayisi yaLeza.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi Aaya kumbungano YakuSimuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Kumungelo wambungano yaku Simuna lemba oobu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">“Aaya ngimajwi ayooyo mutaanzi amamaninino, ooyo wakafwa mpawo wabuka lubo. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ndilizi mapenzi aako abuchete bwako pesi uli muvubi alimwi ndilizi nzibakubejelezya balyaamba kuti mbaJuda alimwi kabatali mbaabo pe, pesi nimbungano yaSatani. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Utayoowi pe atala azeezyo nzuuya kuyoopenzegwa. Laanga, Satani waamba kuwaala bamwi banu muntolongo, kuti mukasunkwe, alimwi kwamazuba alikkumi muyooba mumapenzi. Musyomeke mane kulufu, mpawo ndiyoomupa musini wabuumi.”<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />“Kufumbwa ujisi matwi, ngamvwe Muuya nzuuwamba kumbungano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">“Kufumbwa uzunda taakwe kuyoochisigwa pe kulufu lwachibili.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi Aaya kumbungano yakuPegamamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Kumungelo wakumbungano yakuPegamamu lemba oobu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">“Aaya ngimajwi ayooyo uli apanga libosya mabazu aabili. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ndilikuzi nkukkala, ooko kuli chuuno chabwami bwaSatani, nikuba boobo ukkede kusyomekede kuzina lyangu alimwi taakwe nwakakaka kusyoma kulindime pe nikuba mumazuba aAntipasi kamboni wangu, usyomekede kulindime, wakajayigwa muchisi chanu, ooko Satani nkwakkala. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Pesi ndijisi zintu ziche atala anduwe, ujisi bamwi bantu ooko bajisi injiisyo yaBbalamu, bakayiisya Bbalakki kuti alebye bana baIzirayeli, kuti bakalye chakulya chakapayizigwa kumituni akuchita mamambi. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Aboobo iwe alubo ujisi bamwi bajisilidi anjiisyo yabaNikkolayiti. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Aboobo amusanduke. Kuti kwataba boobo, ndilaza kulindinywe achakufwambana mpawo ndikabalwanisye apanga lyamulomo wangu.”<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“Kufumbwa ooyo ujisi matwi, ngamvwe Muuya mbuwaamba kumbungano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">“Kufumbwa ooyo uzunda ndiyoomupa amwi Mana asisidwe, alimwi ndiyoomupa ibbwe lituba, azina pya lilembedwe alindilyo eelyo litakwe ulizi kunze kwayooyo ulitambula.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi Aaya kumbungano YakuTayitira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Kumungelo wambungano yamuTiyatira lemba oobu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">“Aaya majwi aMwana Mulombe waLeza, ujisi meso ali mbuli bbangabanga amulilo, amawulu aakwe ali mbuli mukuba usalalisya. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ndilizi milimu yako, aluyando lwako, alusyomo, akukutawuuka kwako alukakatilo lwamoyo mulamfu wako, alimwi kuti milimu yako njulikuchita lino mipati kwiinda eeyo mitaanzi. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Pesi ndijisi eechi atala anduwe, kuti wakalekelela mwanakazi Jezebbelu ulyaamba kuti musinsimi alimwi ulayiisya kayeneena balanda bangu mukuchita bumambi akulya zilyo zipayizigwa kumituni. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ndakamupa chiindi chakusanduka, pesi ulakaka kusanduka kuzisusi zyakwe. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ngamulange, ndiyoomuwaala kubulo bwamachise, abaabo bachita bwaamu anguwe ndiyoobawala mumapenzi mapati, kunze akuti basanduka munchito zyakwe, <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />alimwi ndiyoojeya bamutobela. Eelyo imbungano zyoonse ziyooziba kuti ndili ooyo ufunkulula mizeezo amyoyo, mpawo ndiyooliya umwi awumwi mukwiinda kumilimu yakwe.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“Pesi kuli boonse basyomi bali muTiyatira, bakakaka injiisyo eeyi, batana bayiiya kuli bamwi nzibaamba kuti, ‘zintu zinikide zyaSatani,’ kulindinywe ndaamba kuti, tandibikki umbi mukuli pe alindinywe, <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />pesi kuunze kwakuti ngamujatisye luzutu kuli eezyo nzimujisi, mane ndiboole. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Kufumbwa ooyo uzunda ayooyo winkilila anembo kachita milimo yangu kusikila kumamanino, ndiyoomupa nguzu atala amanyika, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />alimwi uyoobeendelezya amusako walubulo, mbuli inongo zyabulongo mbuzipwasulwa muzipanzi zyiingi, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />mbuli mbundakatambula bweendelezi kuzwa kuliTaata, alimwi ooyo ndiyoomupa intanda.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“Kufumbwa ooyo ujisi matwi, ngamvwe Muuya mbuwaamba kumbungano.<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Majwi Aaya Kumbungano YakuSadisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Kumungelo wambungano yakuSadisi lemba oobu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">“Majwi ayooyo ujisi myuuya yaLeza iilimusanu ayibili anyenyezi zilimusanu azibili. “Ndilizi milimo yako, ujisi izina lyakupona, ani ulifwide. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Sinsimuka, uyumye zicheede alimwi zyaamba kufwa. Nkaambo tendakajana milimo yako kilomene pe kubusyu bwaLeza wangu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Nkikaako, yeeya injiisyo njuwabamvwa akutambuula, wiiswilizye, mpawo usanduke. Kuti teewasinsimuka, ndiyooza mbuli mubbi mbachita, tukoyooziba pe chiindi nchindiyooza kulinduwe. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Nikuba boobo mulichili abantu bache biyo muSadisi batana kusofwaazya zisamo zyabo, alimwi bayoyeenda andime muzisamo zituba, nkaambo balaacheelelo. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Kufumbwa ooyo uzunda uyoosamikwa zisamo zituba, alimwi tandikwe kuyoolizima pe izina lyakwe mubbuku lyabuumi, ndiyoolyiita izina lyakwe antanganana kubusyu bwaTaata akubusyu bwabaangelo bakwe.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />“Eelyo kufumbwa ujisi matwi ngamvwe Muuya mbuwaamba kumbungano.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi Aaya Kumbungano yakuFiladelufiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Kumungelo wambungano yakuFiladelufiya lemba oobu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">“Aaya ngimajwi awu usalala, wakasimpe, ooyo ujisi chijuzyo chaDevidi, ooyo ujula kakutakwe ooyo ujala pe. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“ ‘Ndilizi milimo yako. Laanga, ndabika kunembo lyako mulyango ukwazeme, ooyo utakwe ukonzya kuujala, ndilizi kuti ulijisi inguzu ziniini, pesi wakabaamba ijwi lwangu, pesi taakwe nuwakakaka izina lyangu pe. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Laanga, ndiyoochita aabo bali mumbungano yaSatani balyaamba kuti mbaJuda alimwi kabatali mbabo pe, pesi kaba beja biyo. Laanga, ndiyoobachita kuti baboole akuvuntama kunembo lyamawulu aako, mpawo bayooziba kuti ndilakuyanda. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Nkaambo wakabamba ijwi lyangu alukakatilo chamoyo mulamfu, ndiyookukwabilila muchiindi chakusunkwa eecho chiyoobuza anyika yoonse, kukusunka aabo bakkala anyika. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ndiilikuza chakufwambana, jatisisya kuli eecho nchulaacho, kuchitila kuti kutabi umwi ubweza musini wako. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Kufumbwa ooyo uzunda, ndiyoomuchita kuti akabe musemu muŋanda yaLeza wangu, takwe nayoozwa pe mulinjiyo, mpawo ndiyoolemba alinguwe izina lyaLeza wangu, azina lyachisi chaLeza wangu, Jerusalemu mupya useluka kuzwa kujulu kuliLeza wangu, alimwi ndiyoolemba alinguwe izina lyangu ipya.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />“Eelyo, kufumbwa ooyo ujisi matwi, ngamvwe eecho Muuya nchuwaamba kumbungano.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi Aaya Kumbungano YakuLayodisiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Kumungelo wambungano yakuLayodisiya lemba oobu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">“Aaya ngimajwi ayooyo utegwa Ameni, usyomeka akamboni wakasimpe, matalikilo azyoonse Leza nzyakalenga. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ndiilizi milimo yako kuti tutontoli nikuba kupya. Ndalikulombozya kuti nikuunga ulatontola nikuba kupya! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Aboobo, nkaambo kakuti tupyi nikuba kutontola ulakasala, ndiyookuswida kuzwa kumulomo wangu. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Nkaambo waamba kuti, ‘Ndili muvubi, ndazwidilila, alimwi takwe chintu nchindibula pe,’ kutazi pe kuti ufwiisya bweme, ulimuntu biyo, ulimuchete, ulimoofu, alimwi ulichintanda. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Nkikaako ndakulayilila kuti wuule kulindime ingolide iyakasunkwa mumulilo, kuchitila kuti ube muvubi, azisamo zituba zyakusama kuti ukasame akuvumba bweme bwachintanda bwako kuzwa kukubonwa, alimwi ulisikise meso aako, kuti ubone. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Aabo mbindiyanda, ndilabakalalila akubalaya, aboobo amube basungu mpawo musanduke. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Laanga, ndiimvwi amulyango, kandiilikukonkomona, kufumbwa umvwa ijwi lyangu akundijulila mulyango, ndiyoonjila, alimwi ndikalye aawe, mpawo alakwe andime. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Kufumbwa ooyo uzunda ndiyoomupa cheelelo chakukkala andime achuuno changu chabwami, mbuli ndime mbundakazunda akukkala aTaata achuuno chakwe.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Kufumbwa ujisi matwi, ngamvwe Muuya nchuwaamba kumbungano.”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Intembawuzyo Yakujulu KuliLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Nikwakamana zintu eezi ndakalanga, alimwi ndakabona kujulu mulyango ujulikide!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Alimwi ijwi, eelyo ndindakamvwa lutaanzi kalyaambuula kulindime mbuli mweembo, lyakati, “Tansya uze ookuno, alimwi ndikakutondeezye zintu zyeelede kuchitika kwayinda eechi.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Mpawaawo ndakali muMuuya, alimwi ndakabona, kwakaba chuuno chabwami kujulu, awumwi kakkede alinchicho! <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Ooyo wakalikkede mpawo wakali mbuli ibbwe liyandisyi litegwa jasipa abbwe liyandisi litegwa Kkaneliya, alimwi kwakali fulichoongwe uzyungulukide chuuno chabwami ulimbuli musyobo wabbwe liyandisi litegwa Emeraludi. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Eelyo chuuno chabwami chakali zyungulukide azyuuno zyabwami zilimakumi aabili azine, alimwi kwakalikkede ibaalu balimakumi aabili abane azyuuno zyabwami kabasamide midabba ituba, awumwi kabasamide musini wangolide amutwe wakwe. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Kuzwa kuchuuno chabwami kwakamweka indabe, kuvuuma akundindima kwandabi, alimwi kunembo lyachuuno chabwami kwakali kuyaka zimunikisyo zimwekesya alimusanu aabili amulilo, aaya zimunikisyo zyimikilila myuuya yaLeza ilimusanu ayibili, <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />mpawo kunembo lyachuuno chabwami kwakali chibaanga mbuli lwizi lwabbwe libalangala, mbuli ibbwe liyandisyi litegwa Kkirasitalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Alimwi kwali zinyama zine zipona zyakali zyungulukide chuuno chabwami, kazizwide meso kunembo akusule. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Chinyama chitaanzi chipona wakali mbuli mulavu, wachibili wakali mbuli musune waŋombe, wachitatu wakali abusyu bulimbuli bwamuntu, mpawo wachine wakali mbuli nkwazi ilokuuluka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Alimwi zinyama zine zipona, chimwi achimwi chakalijisi mababa alimusanu alimwi, mpawo wakalizwide meso atala koonse amunsi amababa. Tebakaleka pe kwiimba isikati amansiku pe kumutembawula kabati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Ulasalala, ulasalala, ulasalala, nguMwami Leza Singuzu Zyoonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">iwakaliwo, uuliwo, alimwi awuchiyoobuza!”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Kufumbwa chiindi choonse zinyama zipona nizitembawula akupa bulemu akulumba kuli ooyo ukkede achuuno chabwami, upona kwalyoonse alyoonse, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />baalu balimakumi aabili abane balavuntama kunembo lyakwe ooyo ukkede achuuno chabwami akumukomba ooyo upona kwalyoonse alyoonse, kabatula misini yabo kunembo lyachuuno chakwe, kabayimba kuti,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Nduwe weeledwe, Mwami wesu aLeza wesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kutambula bulemu alulemeko anguzu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Nkaambo nduwe wakalenga zintu zyoonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">alimwi mukuyanda kwako zyakabako alimwi zyakalengwa.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Bbuku Amwana Wambelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Eelyo ndakabona muluboko lwakululyo lwayooyo ukkede achuuno chabwami, ibbuku lyakalilembedwe mukati akusule, lyakanamatikwa azisinizyo zilimusanu azibili, <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />mpawo ndakabona mungelo ujisi nguzu kawoompolola ajwi pati kati, “Ngwani weeledwe kubbabbanuna zisinizyo chalyo kujula bbuku eeli?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Pesi taakwe uumwi kujulu nikuba ansi aano nikuba kunsi anyika wakakonzya kujula ibbuku nikuba kubala mukati. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Alimwi ndakalila kapati zyakuti taakwe muntu wakajanika keeledwe kujula bbuku nikuba kubala mukati. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Eelyo umwi wabaalu wakati kulindime, “Utalili, laanga. Mulavu wamukowa waJuda, walunyungu lwaDevidi, wakazunda, ngulaachelelo chakumwaya akujula bbuku azisinizyo zyalyo zilimusanu azibili.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Eelyo ndakabona Mwana wambelele kayimvwi kumbali achuuno chabwami, kabaanga ulijayidwe, alimwi kazyungulukidwe azinyama zine zipona abaalu. Mwana wambelele ooyu wakalijisi meja alimusanu aabili ameso alimusanu aabili, kayimikilila myuuya yaLeza ilimusanu ayibili yakatumwa munyika yoonse. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Mpawo Mwana wambelele wakayinka waakubweza bbuku kuluboko lwakululyo lwayooyo ukkala achuuno chabwami. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Alimwi naakalibweza ibbuku, zinyama zine zipona abaalu balimakumi aabili abane bakavuntama kunembo lyaMwana wambelele, umwi awumwi wabo wakalijisi kantimbwa, andido zyangolide zizwide tununkilizyo, ootu tuninkilizyo ninkombyo zyabasalali. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Mpawo bakayimba lwiimbo lupya, kabati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Nguulacheelelo chakubweza ibbuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">akujula zisinizyo zyalyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Nkaambo abulowa wakawuulila Leza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">mikowa yoonse, amulaka woonse, abantu boonse amanyika woonse,<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />alimwi wakabachita kuti babe babwami abapayizi kuti bakutawukile Leza wesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">mpawo bayooyendelezya munyika.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Eelyo ndakalanga, alimwi ndakamvwa ijwi lyabaangelo bayingi mweelwe wakali zyuulu azyuulu zitabaliki. Alimwi baangelo bakazyungulukila chuuno chabwami azilengwa zipona abaalu zyoonse, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />alimwi bakayimba ajwi pati kabati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Uleeledwe Mwana wambelele wakajayigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">kuti atambule bweendelezi, abuvubi, abusongo, anguzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">alulemeko, abulemu antembawuzyo!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Eelyo ndakamvwa zilengwa zyoonse kujulu aanyika akunsi anyika, amulwizi, azilengwa zyoonse zilimumo, kazyiimba kaziti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Kulinguwe ukkala achuuno chabwami akuMwana wambelele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">kube kulumbayizya, alulemeko, bulemu anguzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">kwalyoonse alyoonse!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Alimwi zilengwa zine zipona zyakati, “Ameni!” Alimwi baalu bakavuntama aansi mpawo bakomba.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Zisinizyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Eelyo ndakabona Mwana wambelele kajula chisinizyo chitaanzi, chazisinizyo zilimusanu azibili mpawo ndakamvwa umwi wazinyama zine zipona kati, ajwi pati lili amuzuzumo, wati, “Kuza!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Alimwi ndakabona, mpawo ndakalanga, imbongolo ituba. Alimwi sikuyeenzya wakali akanta, mpawo wakapegwa musini. Alimwi wakayinka kayabuzunda akuzunda.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Eelyo Mwana wambelele naakajula chisinizyo chachibili, ndakamvwa chinyama chipona chachibili kachiti, “Kuza!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Mpawo kwakazwa imbongolo iimbi, yakali kusalalisya. Sikuyeenzya wakapegwa inguzu wakagwiisya lumuuno munyika, kuti bantu bakajayane. Alimwi wakapegwa ipanga ipati.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Lino Mwana wambelele naakajula chisinizyo chachitatu, ndakamvwa chinyama chipona chachitatu kachiti, “Kuza!” Mpawaawo ndakalanga, mpawo ndakabona imbongolo isiya, alimwi sikuyeenzya wakalijisi zyeelesyo zibili muluboko lwakwe. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Alimwi ndakamvwa chakali kubaanga ndijwi akati kazinyama izine zipona kaliti, “Mweelo walufulu wazilyo buyoowulwa amufolo wamuntu wabuzuba bumwi, amweelwe yamifulu itatu yabbaali iyowulwa amufolo wamuntu wabuzuba bumwi. Pesi utachesyi mafuta nikuba wayini!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Lino Mwana wambelele naakajula chisinizyo chachine, mpawo, ndakamvwa ijwi lyachinyama chachine chipona, kaliti, “Kuza!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Alimwi ndakalanga, mpawo ndakabona, imbongolo ilamubala wasokwe tete linyanide, mpawo, izina lyasikuyeenzya imbongolo wakali kutegwa lufu, alimwi chikkalilo chabafu chakamutobelela kusule afwiifwi, alimwi zyakapegwa nguzu zyiinda chipanzi chimwi kuzipanzi zine zyanyika, kuti zikakujaye apanga, anzala alimwi amalwazi mpawo abanyama bamusokwe bamunyika.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Eelyo Mwana wambelele naakajula chisinizyo chachisanu, ndakabona myuuya yabasyomi kunsi lyachipayililo yabaabo bakajeegwa nkaambo kajwi lyaLeza abukamboni mbubakalijisi, <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />alimwi bakoompolola ajwi pati kabati, “O Mwami Singuzu Zyoonse, usalala awakasimpe! Kuyooba lili, mane ukabeteke bantu bamunyika akubweedezya bulowa bwesu?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Eelyo umwi awumwi wakapegwa mudabba utuba mpawo bakaambilwa kuti balindile kwakayiindi kaniini, mane mweelwe wabalandanyina ababunyina uzulile, aabo bakaleelede kujeegwa mbuli mbabo.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Alimwi ndakabona Mwana wambelele naakalikujula chisinizyo chachisanu achimwi. Kwakaba kundengenda kupati kwanyika, alimwi izuba lyakasiya mbuli chisamo chasaka chisiya, chakabambwa aboya bwampongo busiya mpawo mweezi woonse wakasalala kuba mbuli bulowa. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Inyenyezi zyakujulu zyakalokela anyika, mbuli nkuyu zitanabizwa mbuziloka kumukuyu aawo iguwo pati nilyawutikimuna. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Mulengalenga lyakayinda mbuli bbuku livungidwe, alimwi azilundu zyoonse atusuwa toonse zyakagwisigwa kuzwa kubusena bwazyo. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Eelyo bami banyika abaalumi bapati abeendelezi babasilumamba, abavubi abasinguzu, abantu boonse, abazike abantu baangunukide, bakayuba mumagolo aakati kamabwe amuzilundu, <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />kabaliikwiita zilundu amumabwe kabati, “Amutuwide alimwi mutusise kubusyu bwayooyo ukkede achuuno chabwami, alimwi akuzwa bukali bwaMwana wambelele! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Nkaambo buzuba bupati bwabukali bwabo bwasika, alimwi ngwani ukonzya kubwiimikilila kunembo bwalyo?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Zyuulu Zilimwaanda Azyuulu Zilimakumi Aane Azyuulu Zine Zyabantu BaIzirayeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Musule lyacheechi ime ndiJoni, ndakabona baangelo bane kabayiimvwi kuzyooko zine zyanyika, kabatabilila myuuwo ine yanyika, kuchitila kuti kutabi luuwo luwunga anyika nikuba kulwizi nikuba kufumbwa kutikiniya kumunsamu. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Mpawo ndakabona mungelo uumbi uyabutanta kujulu kuzwa kubuzwezuba, kajisi chisinizyo chaLeza upona. Alimwi wakoongolola ajwi pati kubaangelo bane aabo bakali pedwe nguzu zyakunyonyoona nyika alwizi, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />wati, “Mutanyonyooni nyika niluba lwizi nikuba misamu, mane tukabikke chisinizyo chabalanda baLeza wesu ankumu zyabo.”<verse eid="REV 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Alimwi ndakamvwa mweelwe wabaabo babikkidwe zisinizyo balizyuulu zilimwaanda azyuulu zilimakumi aane azyuulu zine, kuzwa kumikowa yoonse yaIzirayeli, <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />zisinizyo zilizyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waJuda, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waRubbeni, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waGadi, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waAsa, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waNafitali, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waManase, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kumukowa waSimiyoni, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waLevi, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waIsakka, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waZebbuluni, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili kuzwa kumukowa waJozefu, zyuulu zilikkumi azyuulu zibili wazisinizyo kuzwa kumukowa waBbenjamini.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkamu Mpati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Musule acheechi ndakalanga, mpawo kwakali inkamu impati itabaliki yabantu, kuzwa kumanyika woonse, kuzwa kumikowa yoonse akubantu boonse amilaka yoonse, kabayiimvwi kunembo lyachuuno chabwami akunembo lyaMwana wambelele, kabasamide midabba ituba, alimwi mumaboko aabo kabajisi malala, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />alimwi bakalikoompolola ajwi ipati, kabati, “Lufutuko ndulwa Leza wesu ukkede achuuno chabwami akuMwana wambelele!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Alimwi baangelo boonse bakaliimvwi kabazyungulukide chuuno chabwami abaalu, azinyama zine zipona, mpawo bakavundama kunembo lyachuuno chabwami, mpawo bakomba Leza, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />kabati, “Ameni! Kulumbayizya, abulemu, abusongo, akupa kulumba, alulemeko, anguzu, abukozu azibe kuli Leza wesu kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Eelyo umwi wabaalu wakandaambila wati, “Mbaani aaba, basamide midabba ituba, alimwi bazwa kuli?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Ndakaamba kuti kulinguwe, “Inywe, ndinywe nimuzi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Mpawo wakati kulindime, “Aaba mbaaba bakazwa kumapenzi mapati, bakasapa midabba yabo akuyitubya mubulowa bwaMwana wambelele. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Nkikaako nchibayimvwi kunembo lyachuuno chabwami bwaLeza, akumubelekela isikati amansiku muŋanda yakwe, alimwi ooyo ukkala achuuno chabwami uyoobakwabilila. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Tabakwe kuyooba anzala alimbi pe, nikuba anyota lubo, izuba talikoyoobabala pe, nikuba kuumpwa kufumbwa. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Nkaambo Mwana wambelele uli aakati kachuuno chaLeza uyooba mwembeeli wabo, alimwi uyoobazulwida kutusensa twameenda mawuumi. Alimwi Leza uyoosinda misozi yoonse kumeso aabo.<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Chisinizyo Chachisanu Azibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Lino Mwana wambelele naakajula chisinizyo chachisanu azibili, kwakaba luumuno kujulu chakali chaamba kubachisela chahola. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Eelyo ndakabona baangelo balimusanu ababili bakaliimvwi kunembo lyaLeza mpawo bakapegwa myeembo iilimusanu ayibili.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Alimwi umwi mungelo wakali antandabiya yangolide, wakaza mpawo wayimikila kuchipayililo. Alimwi wakapegwa tununkilizyo twiingi kuti amvwelenganiye ankombyo zyabasalali boonse kuti azipedekezye kuliLeza, achipayililo changolide chili kunembo lyachuuno chabwami. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Busi bwatununkilizyo, ankombyo zyabasalali zyakasuka kuya kujulu kuliLeza kuzwa muluboko lwamungelo. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Eelyo mungelo wakabweza chumpilizyo mpawo wachizuzya mulilo kuzwa kuchipayililo alimwi wasowela anyika, mpawo kwakaba kundindima kwandabi, kuvuuma, akumweka kwandabi, akundengenda kwanyika.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Myeembo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Eelyo baangelo balimusanu ababili ibakalijisi myeembo iilimusanu aayibili bakalibambila kwiilizya.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Mungelo mutaanzi wakalizya mweembo wakwe, mpawo kwakawa chivulamabwe amulilo, uvweleene abulowa, zyakawisigwa anyika. Chipanzi chimwi kuzipanzi zitatu chanyika chakapya, alimwi chipanzi chimwi kuzipanzi zitaatu zyamisamu chakapya, asokwe tete lyoonse lyakapya.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Mungelo wachibili wakalizya mweembo wakwe, mpawo chintu chili mbuli chilundu chipati, chiyaka mulilo, chakawaalilwa mulwizi. Alimwi chipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu chalwizi chakaba bulowa, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />achipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu zyazinyama zipona mulwizi zyakafwa, achipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu chamaato akanyonyoonwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Mungelo wachitatu wakalizya mweembo wakwe, alimwi inyenyeezi mpati yakawa kuzwa kujulu, kayimweka mbuli chimwinikisyo, alimwi yakawida achipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu zyamilonga amutusensa twameenda. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Izina lyanyenyezi litegwa, “Mululwe.” chipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu chameenda chakalula, alimwi bantu bayiingi bakafwa nkaambo meenda aayo akali alula.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Mungelo wachine wakalizya mweembo wakwe, alimwi chipanzi chimwi kuzipanzi zitatu chazuba chakasizigwa, achipanzi chimwi kuzwa kuzipanzi zitatu chamweezi, achipanzi chimwi kuzwa kuzipanzi zitatu chanyeenyezi, mane chipanzi chimwi kuzipanzi zitatu chamumuni wabo chakasizigwa, chipanzi chimwi kuzwa kuzipanzi zitatu chabuzuba chakakasigwa kukubala, alimwi mbuboobu chipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu chabusiku.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Alimwi ndakalanga, mpawo ndakamvwa nsika kiilila ajwi pati, niyakali kuwuluka mumulengalenga kayiti, “Maawe, Maawe, Maawe kuli aabo bakkala anyika, nkaambo kwakulila kwamyeembo eeyo baangelo batatu ibaambi njibakali baamba kulizya!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Alimwi mungelo wachisanu wakalizya mweembo wakwe, mpawo ndakabona inyenyeezi kiiwide anyika kuzwa kujulu, alimwi wakapegwa chijuzyo champako iya kumulindi utagoli. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Naakajula mpako iya kumulindi utagoli, mpawo kuzwa kumulindi utagoli kwakazwa busi buli mbuli busi bwamvuto mpati, mpawo izuba amuuwo zyakasizigwa abusi buzwa kumulindi, <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />eelyo kuzwa mubusi kwakazwa chikwiikwi anyika, alimwi chakapegwa inguzu zilimbuli inguzu zyatubanze twanyika. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Chakaambilwa kuti chitanyonyooni bwizu pe anyika, nichiba chintu chimwi chisyuuka, nuuba musamu, pesi bantu abalikke aabo batajisi chisinizyo chaLeza ankumu zyabo, <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />chakazumizigwa kubeempya kwamyeezi ilimusanu, pesi peepe kubajaya, mpawo lweempyo lwacho lwakali mbuli lweempyo lwakabanze, nikaluma muntu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mpawo mumazuba aayo bantu bayooyanduula lufu alimwi tabakalujani pe, bayooyandisya kufwa, pesi lufu luyoobachija.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Muchiimo chikwiikwi chakalikozyene ambongolo zibambilwa inkondo, amitwe yazyo yakali mbuli misini yangolide, busyu bwacho bwakali mbuli busyu bwabamuntu, <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />susu lyacho lyakali mbuli masusu abanakazi, amenyo aacho akali mbuli menyo abalavu, <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />chakalijisi chikwabilizyo chilimbuli chachibulo chakaango, alimwi muzuzumo wamababa aacho akali mbuli nkalaki zyambongolo nyiingi zizuzaanina kunkondo. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Chakalijisi michila mbuli tubanze, yakali alumoola, alimwi mumichila eeyo chakalijisi inguzu zyakuchisa bantu kwamyeezi iilimusanu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Chilijisi mbuli mwami wacho mungelo wamulindi utagoli, izina lyakwe muchi Hebburu utegwa nguAbbadoni, alimwi muchi Girikki utegwa nguApoliyoni.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Ipenzi taanzi lyakayinda, laanga, mapenzi aabili achiza.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Eelyo mungelo wachisanu awumwi wakalizya mweembo wakwe, mpawo ndakamvwa ijwi lizwa kumeja aane achipayililo changolide chilikunembo lyaLeza, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />kalyaambila mungelo wachisanu awumwi iwakalijisi mweembo kaliti, “Wangununa baangelo bane baangidwe mumulonga mupati Yufuretizi.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Mpawo baangelo bane bakaangununwa aabo bakabambilidwe kwahola, kwazuba, kwamweezi akwamumwaaka, kukujaya chipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu zyabantu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Mweelwe wabasinkondo bambongolo wakali zyuulu zilimwaanda zyindulwidwe amakumi abili ndakamvwa mweelwe wabo. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Alimwi eechi mbumbubo mbundakabona mbongolo muchilengano changu, aabo basikuyeenzya bakalisamide zikwabilizyo zyakaango zyamisyobo isalala, awasikkaka, awamuntondo alimwi mitwe yambongolo yakali mbuli mitwe yabalavu, alimwi kumilomo yazyo kwakazwa mulilo, abusi asalufa. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Azeezi zyuumo zitatu, chipanzi chimwi kuzwa kuzipanzi zitatu zyabantu chakajeegwa, amulilo, abusi, asalufa kazizwa kumilomo yazyo mbongolo. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Nkaambo inguzu zyambongolo zilimumilomo yazyo amumichila yazyo, michila yazyo ilimbuli bazoka, imbongolo eezyo zyakalikubelesya mitwe eeyo kukupa zilonda kubantu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Bamwi bantu, ibatakwe bakajeegwa azyuumo eezi, tee bakasanduka pe kumilimo yamaanza aabo nikuba kuleka kupiila mizimu amituni yangolide, yansiliva, yamukuba, yabbwe, ayachisamu, zitakonzyi kubona nikuba kumvwa nikuba kweenda, <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />taakwe nibakasanduka pe kubujayi bwabo, nikuba kubulozi bwabo, nikuba kumamambi aabo, nikuba kukubba kwabo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Mungelo aKabbuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Eelyo ndakabona mungelo uumbi singuzu kaza buseluka kuzwa kujulu, kazambayidwe mujoba, afulichoongo atala amutwe wakwe, alimwi busyu bwakwe bwakali mbuli izuba, amawulu aakwe akali mbuli misemu yamulilo. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Wakali jisi kabbuku kakali julidwe muluboko lwakwe. Mpawo wakalyata kuulu kwakwe kwakululyo atala alwizi, akuulu kwakwe kwakulumwesi kaluli anyika, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />alimwi wakoompolola ajwi pati, mbuli mulavu uvuluma, naakoompolola, mizuzumo iilimusanu ayibili yakandindima. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Alimwi mizuzumo iilimusanu ayibili niyakandindima, ndakali ndaamba kulemba, pesi ndakamvwa ijwi lizwa kujulu kaliti, “Sisa eezyo mizuzumo iilimusanu ayibili nziyaamba, alimwi utazilembi aansi pe.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Alimwi mungelo ngundakabona kayimvwi alwizi aanyika wakatambika luboko lwakwe lwakululyo kujulu <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />alimwi wakakonka ayooyo upona kalyoonse alyoonse, wakalenga julu azili mulindilyo, anyika azili mulinjiyo, alwizi azili mulindulo, mpawo wakati, “Kutabi kuchedwa lubo, <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />pesi mumazuba akulila kwamweembo uyoolizigwa amungelo wachisanu ababili, insiinswa yaLeza, mbuli mbakaambilizya kubalanda bakwe basinsimi, zyeelede kuzuzukizigwa.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Eelyo ijwi ndindakamvwa kuzwa kujulu lyakaamba lubo kulindime kaliti, “Kuya, bweza bbuku lijulidwe muluboko lwamungelo wiimvwi atala alwizi aanyika.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Aboobo ndakayinka kumungelo mpawo ndakamwaambila kuti andipe kabbuku mpawo wakati kulindime, “Bweza mpawo ukalye, kakanona mbuli buchi mumulomo wako, pesi kayoolula mwida lyako.”<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Alimwi ndakabweza kabbuku muluboko lwamungelo mpawo ndakakalya, kakali kunona mbuli buchi mumulomo wangu, pesi nindakakalya mubula bwangu kakali kulula. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Mpawo ndakaambilwa kuti, “Uleelede lubo usinsime atala abantu bayingi, amanyika mayiingi, andimi zyiingi, abaami bayiingi.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Bakamboni Babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Eelyo ndakapegwa kasamu kakwelesya kali mbuli mufunko, alimwi wakati kulindime, “Buka mpawo weele iŋanda yaLeza achipayililo akubala baabo bakomba mumo, <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />pesi uteeli kunze kwalubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza, ulusiye, nkaambo lupedwe aabo batamuzi Leza, alimwi bayoolyata chisi chisalala kwamyeezi ilimakumi aane ayibili. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Alimwi ndiyoopa bakamboni bangu babili inguzu zyakusinsima kabasamide zisamo zyamasaka kwamazuba alichuulu amyaanda ibili amakumi alimusanu akkumi limwi.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Aaba bakamboni ibabili njimisamu ibili yamusamu utegwa mu olivu azibikilo zyazimunikisyo zibili ziimvwi kunembo lyaMwami wanyika. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Alimwi kuti umwi wayanda kubanyonyoona, mulilo ulazwa kumulomo wabo akunyonyoona basinkondonyina, kuti umwi wayanda kubanyonyoona, mbumbubo alakwe mbweelede kujeegwa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Balaanguzu zyakujala ijulu, kuti taakwe mvula inga ilawa pe mumazuba akusinsima kwabo, alimwi balijisi inguzu zyakusandula meenda kuti abe bulowa, akuuma nyika azyuumo zyoonse, kufumbwa mpubayandila.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Alimwi nibakamanisya kupa bukamboni bwabo, chinyama chizwa mumulindi utagoli chiyoobalwanisya akubazunda akubajeya, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />mpawo mitunta yabo iyoolala mumugwagwa wachisi chipati ooyo uyimikilila muunzi utegwa Sodomu aIjiputi, ooko Mwami wabo nkwaakagankaminwa. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kwamazuba ataatu achisela, chabantu boonse bazwa, kumikowa yoonse, amilaka yoonse, amanyika woonse bayoobona mitumba yabo ifwide mpawo bakakake kuti bazikkwe muzibunda. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Mpawo aabo bakkala munyika bayookondwa atala lyabo akusekelela akwabana zipo, nkaambo aaba basinsimi babili bakapenzya aabo bakkala munyika. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Pesi nikwakayinda mazuba ataatu achisela, luyooyo lwabuumi luzwa kuliLeza lwakabanjila, alimwi bakayimikila amawulu aabo, mpawo kwakaba kuyoowa kupati kuli aabo bakababona. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Eelyo bakamvwa ijwi pati lizwa kujulu kaliti kulimbabo, “Amutante ajulu!” Mpawo kubusyu bwabasinkondonyina bakatanta kujulu mujoba. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Alimwi kuhola eelyo kwakali kundengenda kupati kwanyika, alimwi kwakawisya chipanzi chimwi kuzwa kuzipanzi zilikkumi zyachisi, kwakajeegwa bantu balizyuulu zilimusanu azibili mukundengenda kwanyika, mpawo bayingi bakayoowa alimwi bakapa bulemu kuzina lyaLeza wakujulu. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ipenzi lyachibili lyakayinda, ngamubone, ipenzi lyachitatu lyaba afwiifwi kuza.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mweembo Wachisanu Ayibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Eelyo mungelo wachisanu ababili wakalizya mweembo, alimwi kwakali majwi awompololesya mujulu, kaati, “Bwami bwaansi bwaba bwami kwaMwami wesu abwaKkirisitu wakwe, alimwi uyoyeendelezya kwalyoonse alyoonse.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Alimwi baalu balimakumi aabili abane bakalikkede azyuuno zyabo zyabwami kunembo lyaLeza bakavundama mpawo bakomba Leza, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />kabati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Tupa kulumba kuli nduwe, Mwami Leza Singuzu Zyoonse, uliwo awakaliwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">nkaambo wabweza nguzu zyakwe mpati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">mpawo watanguna kweendelezya,<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />abatamuzi pe Leza bakanyema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nkaambo chindi chabukali bwako chasika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">achiindi chabafu kuti babetekwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">kuti balanda bakwe bapegwe bulumbu, basinsimi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">abasalali, abaabo bayoowa zina lyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">boonse baniini abapati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">alimwi akunyonyoona basikunyonyoona nyika.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Eelyo ŋanda yaLeza kujulu yakali bukwazi, mpawo bbokesi lyachizuminano lyakaboneka muŋanda yaLeza, alimwi kwakali kumweka kwalulabe, kuvuma, kundindima kwandabe, kundengenda kwanyika, achivulamabwe chipati.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Mwanakazi Asimwaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Alimwi chigambyo chipati chakaliboniya kujulu. Kwakali mwanakazi, zisamo zyakwe zyakali zuba, amweezi kunsi amawulu aakwe, mpawo amusini wanyeenyezi amutwe wakwe zilikkumi azibili. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Wakali mitide alimwi wakalila kumyoongwa amachise akutumbuka.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Mpawo kwakayubunuka chigambyo chipati kumulengalenga. Laanga, simwaaba mupati usalalisya, wakali amitwe iilimusanu ayibili ameja alikkumi, alimwi amisini iilimusanu ayibili amitwe yakwe. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mpawo muchila wakwe wakayila chipanzi chimwi chazipanzi zitatu chanyeenyezi zyamulengalenga, mpawo wakaziwisizya anyika. Alimwi simwaaba wakayimikila kunembo lyamwanakazi wakali waamba kutumbuka mwana, kuti atumbuka alye mwana wakwe. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Eelyo mwanakazi ooyu wakatumbuka mwana mulombe, ooyo uyooyendelezya manyika woonse amusako walubulo. Pesi mwana wakwe mulombe wakakwempwa kuliLeza akuchuuno chakwe. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Mpawo mwanakazi wakachijila munkanda, kubusena oobo Leza mbwaakamubambila, ooko nkwakasaninwa kwamazuba alichuulu amyaanda iibili amakumi alimusanu akkumi limwi.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Lino kwakabuka nkondo kujulu. Mikkayeli abaangelo bakwe bakalwanisya simwaaba, alakwe simwaaba abaangelo bakwe kabali kubalwaniya lubo, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />pesi simwaaba wakazundwa, mpawo teekwakachili busena bwabo pe kujulu. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Alimwi simwaaba mupati wakawalilwa aansi, ooyo muzoka wachiindi, utegwa Sikuchenga Mupati aSatani, sikuchenga nyika yoonse. Wakawalilwa aansi anyika, abaangelo bakwe<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Eelyo ndakamvwa ijwi kalyoompolola kujulu, kaliti, “Lino lwasika lufutuko lwaLeza anguzu zyakwe abwami bwakwe abweendelezi bwaKkirisitu wakwe, nkaambo sikubejelezya bakwesu wawaalilwa aansi, ubabejelezya sikati amasiku kunembo lyaLeza wesu. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Alimwi bakamuzunda abulowa bwaMwana wambelele ajwi lyabukamboni bwabo, nkaambo teebakabuyanda buumi bwabo mane kuyoosika kulufu. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Eelyo nkaambo kacheechi O majulu ngamusekelela, alanu nimukkala mumo! Pesi maawe kulinduwe, O nunyika alwizi, nkaambo Sikuchenga waselukila kulindinywe abukali bupati, nkaambo ulizi kuti chiindi chakwe chachaala nchifwiifwi!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Alimwi simwaaba naakabona kuti wawaalilwa aansi kunyika, wakaandilila mwanakazi wakatumbuka mwana mulombe. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Pesi mwanakazi wakapegwa mababa aabili ansika mpati kuchitila kuti awuluke kuzwa kumuzoka aaye munkanda, kubusena bwakwe mbwakalileledwe kwachiindi, akwazyiindi akwachisela chachiindi kukukwabililwa kulisimwaaba. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Muzoka wakaselwida mwanakazi meenda aali mbuli mulonga kuzwa mumulomo wakwe, kuti atolwe azambangulwe. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Pesi inyika yakagwasya mwanakazi, aawo nyika niyakajula mulomo wayo mpawo yamena mulonga ooyo simwaaba ngwakali waselula kuzwa kumulomo wakwe. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Eelyo simwaaba wakanyemena mwanakazi, mpawo wakayinka kuyoochita nkondo kulunyungu lwamwanakazi ooyu loonse, kulibaabo babamba malayilile aLeza akupa bukamboni kuliJesu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Alimwi simwaaba wakayimikila amuse wankomwe yalwizi.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Zinyama Zibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Alimwi ndakabona chinyama chizwa mulwizi. Chakali ameja alikkumi amitwe iilimusanu ayibili, atala ameja kwakali misini ilikkumi, mpawo atala amitwe kwakali zina lisampawula Leza. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Alimwi chinyama nchindakabona chakali mbuli nemba, mawulu aacho akali mbuli mawulu agwibba, amulomo wacho wakali mbuli mulomo wamulavu. Mpawo kuli nchicho simwaaba wakachipa nguzu zyakwe, achuuno chakwe abweendelezi bupati. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Mutwe umwi kumitwe wachinyama wakali kubaanga ulaachilonda chakufwa, pesi chilonda chacho chakapona, mpawo nyika yoonse yakatobela chinyama akugamba. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Bantu boonse bakakomba simwaaba, nkaambo wakali wapa bweendelezi bwakwe kuchinyama, mpawo bakakomba chinyama, kabati, “Ngwani ukozyene achinyama, alimwi ngwani ukonzya kulwana aacho?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Mpawo chinyama chakapegwa mulomo wakugwisya majwi akulisumpula akusampawula Leza, alimwi chakazumizigwa kweendelezya kwamyeezi ilimakumi aane amweezi iibili. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Chakajula mulomo wacho kuti chisampawule Leza, akusampawula zina lyakwe achikalilo chakwe, chaamba kuti, aabo boonse bakkala kujulu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Alubo chakazumizigwa kuti chichite nkondo kubasalali akubazunda, alimwi chakapegwa bweendelezi atala amukowa woonse, abantu boonse, amulaka woonse, anyika zyoonse. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Alimwi aabo boonse bakkala munyika bayoochikomba, woonse ulaazina litalembedwe kuzwa kumatalikilo anyika mubbuku lyabuumi lyaMwana wambelele ooyo wakajeegwa.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />“Eelyo, kufumbwa ujisi matwi, ngamvwe! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Kufumbwa weleede kutolwa mubuzike, ulatolwa mubuzike, kufumbwa weleede kujeegwa apanga, apanga weleede kuyoojeegwa. Eezi ziyanda lukakatilo alusyomo lwabasalali.”<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Eelyo ndakabona chimbi chinyama, chakazwa munyika, chakali ameja aabili mbuli Mwana wambelele alimwi chakali kwaambuula mbuli simwaaba. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Chakali kuchita bweendelezi boonse bwachinyama chitaanzi mubusena bwacho. Alimwi akuchita nyika abantu bali mulinjiyo kuti zikombe chinyama chitaanzi, chilaachilonda chapona. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Eechi chinyama chachibili chakachita zitondeezyo zipati, chakachita mulilo kuti uloke anyika kuzwa kujulu bantu kababweene. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Chakeena aabo bakkala munyika, azitondeezyo eezyo nzichizumizigwa kubeleka kunembo lyachinyama chakabaambila kuchita chikozyano chachinyama wakali lichiside apanga nikuba kuti chakali chapona, <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />alimwi chakazumizigwa kupa luyoyo kuchikozyano chachinyama kuchitila kuti chikozyano chachinyama cheelede nikuba kwaambuula, akuchitisya aabo batakakake kukomba chikozyano chachinyama chitaanzi beelede kujeegwa. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Alubo chakaangila boonse, baniini abapati, bavubi abachete, boonse baangunukide abazike, kuti babikkwe impa kuluboko lwakululyo lwabo nikuba ankumu zyabo, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />kuchitila kuti kutabi umwi ukonzya kuula nikuba kuuzya kunze akuti abe ampa, nkukuti, eeli ndizina lyachinyama nikuba mweelwe wazina lyacho.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Eechi chiyanda busongo, leka ooyo umvwisisisya aambe mweelwe wachinyama, nkaambo mweelwe wamuntu, mweelwe wacho myaanda ilimusanu amwaanda uumwi amakumi alimusanu akkumi limwi lilamweelwe ulimusanu awumwi.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwana Wambelele Abantu Bakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Eelyo ndakalanga, mpawo ndakabona, kwakaliimvwi Mwana wambelele achilundu chaZiyoni, wakali abantu balizyuulu zilimwaanda azyuulu zilimakumi aane azyuulu zine bakali azina lwakwe azina lyaWisi kalilembedwe ankumu zyabo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Mpawo ndakamvwa ijwi lizwa kujulu lyakali mbuli kuvuuma kwameenda mayiingi ayeenda ambuli muzuzumo mupati, muzumzumo ngundakamvwa wakali mbuli muungumina wabasituntimbwa mbubalizya tuntimbwa twabo, <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Mpawo bakayiimba lwiimbo lupya kunembo lyachuuno chabwami akunembo lyazinyama zine zipona abaalu. Taakwe pe unga ulayiiya lwiimbo oolu kunze kwabali zyuulu zilimwaanda azyuulu zilimakumi aane azyuulu zine zyakanununwa kuzwa kunyika. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Aaba mbaabo baalumi batakwe bakalisofwaazya pe abanakazi, nkaambo tabanaswanana abanakazi pe, mbimbabo batobela Mwana ambelele koonse nkwaya, aaba bakanununwa kuzwa kubantu mbuli michelo mitaanzi yaLeza waMwana wambelele, <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Alimwi mumilomo yabo teemwakajanwa bubeji, nkaambo tabakwe mulandu pe.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baangelo Batatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Eelyo ndakabona mungelo uumbi wuuluka mumulengalenga, kaala makani mabotu ateeli akukambawukila baabo bakkala munyika, anyika zyoonse, akumukowa woonse, akumulaka woonse abantu boonse, <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />mpawo wakoompolola ajwi pati wati, “Muyoowe Leza akumupa bulemu, nkaambo chiindi chalubeteko lwakwe chasika, mpawo mumukombe ooyo wakalenga majulu anyika, lwizi atusensa twameenda.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Umwi mungelo, wachibili, wakatobela, kati, “Yawa, yawa Bbabbiloni mpati, eeyo wakachita manyika woonse kuti anywe wayini wabukali wazisusi zyakwe zyabubi.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Alimwi mungelo uumbi, wachitatu, wakabatobela, kawoompolola ajwi pati kati, “Kuti umwi wakomba chinyama achikozyano chacho, akuzumina kubikkwa impa ankumu yakwe nikuba aluboko lwakwe, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />alubo uyoonywa wayini wabukali bwaLeza, utilwa uvwelengene kapati mumufulu alunyemo lwakwe, alimwi uyoopenzegwa amulilo wuumpa utegwa salufa kunembo lyabaangelo basalala akunembo lyaMwana wambelele. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Mpawo busi bwakupenzegwa kwabo bulaya kujulu kwalyoonse alyoonse, alimwi tabajisi kulyookezya, sikati nikuba masiku, aaba bakomba chinyama achikozyano chacho, awoonse ooyo uzumina impa yazina lyacho.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Eechi chiyanda lukakatilo lwabasalali, aabo babamba milawu yaLeza, abasyomekede kuliJesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Eelyo ndakamvwa ijwi lizwa kujulu kaliti, “Lemba oobu, Bali achoolwe aabo bafwida muMwami kuzwa sunu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">“Iiyi bali achoolwe,” Mbuwamba Muuya, “Kuti balyookezye kumilimu yabo, nkaambo milimu yabo ilabatobela!<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutebula Kwanyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Eelyo ndakalanga, mpawo ndakabona, ijoba lituba, mpawo wakalikkede ajoba wakali mbuli umwi mwana mulombe amuntu, wakali amusini wangolide amutwe wakwe, akafulo kabosya kuluboko lwakwe. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Mpawo mungelo uumbi wakaza kazwa muŋanda yaLeza, kayita ajwi pati kuli ooyo wakalikkede ajoba pati kati, “Belesya kafulo kako, mpawo utebule, alimwi chiindi chakutebula chasika, nkaambo butebuzi bwanyika bwabizwa.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Aboobo ooyo ukkede atala ajoba wakavwikuzya kafulo kakwe anyika, mpawo nyika yakatebulwa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Mpawo mungelo uumbi wakazwa muŋanda yaLeza, alakwe wakalijisi kafulo kabosya.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Eelyo mungelo uumbi wakazwa kuchipayililo, mungelo wakali abweendelezi atala amulilo mpawo wakayita ajwi pati kuli ooyo wakali akafulo kabosya wati, “Belesya kafulo kako kabosya mpawo ubungike zikata zyamisansa yanyika, nkaambo masansa aayo abizwa.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Mpawo mungelo wakavwikuuzya kafulo kakwe anyika mpawo wakabunganiya masansa anyika, mpawo wakawaala muchikandilo chipati chamasansa chalunyemo lwaLeza. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Alimwi chikandilo chamasansa chakali kukandilwa aanze achisi, mpawo bulowa bwakakunka kuzwa kuchikandilo chamasansa, mane bwiime bwabulamfu bwabulowa bwakasika kuzwa aansi kuyoosika kunsingo yambongolo, kwamusinzo wantaamo zyakachibe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwaanda itatu yamaKkilimita</char></note>zyuulu zyiindulidwe myaanda iitatu.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Baangelo Bala Zyuumyo Zyamamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Eelyo ndakabona chitondezyo chimbi kujulu, chipati alimwi chigambya, baangelo balimusanu ababili bajisi zyuumyo zilimusanu azibili, zyakumamanino, nkaambo alinzizyo bukali bwaLeza bwajinka.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Alimwi ndakabona chakaliboniya mbuli lwizi luli mbuli ibbwe libalangala livwelene amulilo, abaabo bakalikuzunda chinyama achikozyano chacho amweelwe wazina lyacho, bakaliimvwi atala alwizi luli mbuli ibbwe libalangala atuntimbwa twaLeza mumaboko aabo. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Alimwi balayimba lwiimbo lwaMozesi, mulanda waLeza, alwiimbo lwaMwana wambelele, kabati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“O Mwami Leza Singuzu Zyoonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">milimo yako mipati alimwi ilagambya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">O Mwami wazyiindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Nzila zyako nzyalusinizyo, zililuleme!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />O Mwami, ngwani utakuyoowi, akulemeka zina lyako?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Nkaambo nduwe awulikke usalala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Manyika woonse ayooza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">kuzookukomba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">nkaambo milimu yako iluleme yakayubununwa.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Musule kwacheechi ndakalanga, mpawo ndakabona ŋanda lyaLeza kujulu, ndidyuumba lyabukamboni kalikwezeme, <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />mpawo muŋanda eeyo mwakazwa baangelo balimusanu ababili bakalijisi zyuumyo zilimusanu azibili, kabasamide midabba ituba ingengema, alimwi atwaango twabo kabasamide kadabba kamwingwankwa kangolide. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Alimwi chimwi chazinyama zine zipona chakapa baangelo balimusanu ababili indido zyangolida zilimusanu azibili zizwide bukali bwaLeza upona kwalyoonse alyoonse, <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Mpawo ŋanda yaLeza yakazula busi buzwa kubulemu bwaLeza akunguzu zyakwe, mpawo taakwe wakakonzya kunjila muŋanda yaLeza mane eezyo zyuumo zilimusanu azibili zyabaangelo balimusanu ababili zyakazuzikizigwa.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Indido Zyabukali BwaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Eelyo ndakamvwa ijwi ipati kalyoompolola kalizwa muŋanda yaLeza kalyaambila baangelo balimusanu ababili kaliti, “Kamuya alimwi mukatile anyika indido zilimusanu azibili zyabukali bwaLeza.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Aboobo mungelo mutaanzi wakayinka kuyootila ndido yakwe anyika, mpawo kwakazwa zilonda zibi zikataazya kubantu aabo bakalijisi impa yachinyama abakakomba chikozyano chacho.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Mungelo wachibili wakatila ndido yakwe mulwizi, mpawo meenda akaba mbuli bulowa bwamuntu ufwide, azyoonse zipona mulwizi zyakafwa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Mungelo wachitatu wakatila ndido yakwe mumilonga amutusensa twameenda, eelyo meenda akaba bulowa. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Mpawo ndakamvwa mungelo ooyo wendeelezya meenda kaamba kuti, “O Usalala, iwe uliwo awakaliwo, nkaambo uliluleme mulubeta oolu, <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />nkaambo bantu bakatila bulowa bwabasalali abwabasinsimi, aboobo wakabapa bulowa bwakunywa. Mbuli mbubeelede!” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Eelyo ndakamvwa ijwi kalizwa kuchipayililo kaliti, “Mbukubede, Mwami Leza Singuzu Zyoonse, kasimpe abululami ndubeta lwako!”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Mungelo wachine wakatila ndido yakwe kuzuba, mpawo zuba lyakazumizigwa kuumpa bantu akupya kwalyo. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Bantu bakawumpwa akupya kuyoosya, alimwi bakatukila zina lyaLeza uli anguzu atala azyuumyo eezi, mpawo teebakasanduka pe akumupa bulemu.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Mungelo wachisanu wakatila ndido yakwe achuuno chabwami bwachinyama, mpawo bwami bwacho bwakali mumudima, bantu bakaluma lulimi lwabo mumachise, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />alimwi bakatukila Leza wakujulu ankaambo kazilonda amachise, alimwi teebakasanduka pe kumilimu yabo mibi.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Mungelo wachisanu awumwi wakatila ndido yakwe mumulonga mupati Yufuretizi, mpawo meenda aawo akayuminina, kukubambilila inzila yabaami bakujwe. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Eelyo ndakabona, myuuya itatu isofweede ilimbuli bachulwa nkizwa mumulomo wasimwaaba, akumulomo wachinyama akumulomo wamusinsimi mubeji. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Eeyi myuuya yabasikazwa, eeyo ichita zitondeezyo, mpawo ileenda kuya kubaami banyika yoonse, kuti ikababunganiye kunkondo yabuzuba bupati bwaLeza Singuzu Zyoonse.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Laanga, ndilaboola mbuli mubbi! Ulaachoolwe ooyo ulangilila akubamba zyakusama zyakwe kuti ateendi chintanda akubonwa!”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Alimwi bakababunganiya aamwi mubusena butegwa muchiHebburu Amagedoni.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Mungelo wachisanu ababili wakatila indido yakwe muluuwo, mpawo kwakazwa ijwi ipati muŋanda yaLeza, lizwa kuchuuno chabwami, lyakati, “Kwamana!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Mpawaawo kwakaba kumweka kwandabe, kuvuuma, akundindima kwandabe, akundengenda kupati kwanyika eeyo utakwe wakaba pe kuzwa bantu nibakali anyika, aboobo kwakali kundengenda kwanyika kupati! <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Chisi chipati chakapambulwa muzipanzi zitatu, azisi zyamanyika zyakawa, alimwi Leza wakayeeya Bbabbiloni impati, kuti ayichite kuti inywe mufulu wakwe wawayini yabukali bwakwe. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Mpawo tusuwa toonse twakamwayika, alimwi taakwe zilundu pe zyakajanwa. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Alimwi chivulamabwe chipati, ichimwi kachijisi bulemu mbuli mugomo ibili amagaloni abili, chakawida abantu kuzwa kumulengalenga, mane bantu batukila Leza ankaambo kachuumyo chachivulamabwe, aboobo chakayoosya kapati chuumyo eecho.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Simamambe Ulaampuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Eelyo umwi wabaangelo balimusanu ababili aabo ibakalijisi indido zilimusanu azibili, wakasika kulindime mpawo wati, “Kuza, alimwi ndikakutondeezye chisubulo nchayoopegwa simamambe mupati ooyu, ooyo ukkede atala ameenda mayiingi, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Nguwe ngubakachita awe bumaambi abaami baanyika, abantu boonse bakkala munyika bakakolwa awayini wabumambi bwakwe.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Lino munguzu zyaMuuya wakanditola kunkanda, eelyo ndakabona mwanakazi, ulikkede achinyama chisalala chizwide mazina akusampawula, alimwi chakalijisi mitwe iilimusanu ayibili ameja alikkumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Mwanakazi ooyo wakalisamide zyakusama zyadowalowa azisalala pilibili, alubo wakali lisakatide angolide amabwe mayandisi angale, alimwi muluboko lwakwe wakalijisi chinywido changolide chizwide zisesemyo amatombe amamambe aakwe, <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Alimwi ankumu yakwe akalilembedwe izina lilamakani alansinswa, yaamba kuti, “Bbabbiloni mupati ngubanyina abasimamambi azisesemyo zyanyika.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Alimwi ndakabona kuti mwanakazi ooyo ulikoledwe abulowa bwabasalali abulowa bwabaabo ibakajayigwa nkaambo kaJesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Eelyo nindakamubona ndakagamba akugamba kupati. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Mpawo mungelo wakati kulindime, “Nkaamboonzi nuwagamba? Ime ndiyookupandulwida insiiswa yamwanakazi ooyu ayachinyama nchimunyampwide chijisi mitwe iilimusanu ayibili ameja alikkumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Eecho chinyama nchuwakabona chakaliko, pesi lino tachichiko, alimwi chaamba kuzwa mumulindi utagoli akwiinka kuya kukunyonyoonwa, alimwi bantu bakkala munyika bayoogamba, nkukuti aabo batana kulembwa mazina mubbuku lyabuumi kuzwa kumatalikilo anyika. Bayoogamba bakubona chinyama mbuchakaliko, alimwi lino tachichiko, nekubaboobo chaamba kubola lwachibili.”<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Eechi chiyanda busongo akumvwisisya, mitwe ilimusanu ayibili ntutulundu tulimusanu atubili ooko mwanakazi mpakkede. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Alimwi nkubali bami lubo balimusanu ababili. Balimusanu tabachiwo pe, umwi mpachili lino, umwi tana sika, Lino asika ooyo, uleelede ayeendelezye kwakayiindi kaniini. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Chinyama chakaliwo, pesi lino tachiwo pe, ngumwami wachisanu abatatu. Pesi nguumwi wabaabo wabalimusanu ababili, alimwi uya kukuyonyonyoonwa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Alimwi meja alikkumi nguwakabona mbami balikkumi, aabo batana kutambula bwami, pesi aabo bayoyeendelezya mbuli bami kwahola limwi, aamwi achinyama. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Aaba bajisi muzeezo uumwi. Boonse bayoopa chinyama inguzu zyabo abwendelezi bwabo. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Alimwi bayoolwana aMwana wambelele, pesi Mwana wambelele uyoobazunda, abaabo bayitidwe, abasale, abasyomekede, nkaambo nguunguwe Mwami wabami, Nguumweendelezi wabeendelezi.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Alimwi mungelo wakati kulindime, “Meenda nguwakabona nkwakkala ooyu mwanakazi simamambe mbibantu amakamu, amanyika amilaka. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Meja alikkumi ngwakabona, achinyama, bayoomunyonyoona simamambi, bakamusiye kalichintanda, bayoolya mubili wakwe akumuumpa amulilo, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />nkaambo Leza wakachibikka mumyoyo yabo muzeezo wakulomya kuyanda kwakwe, akuzumina chamoyo umwi kupa chinyama bwami bwabo, mane majwi aLeza akazuzikizigwe.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Lino mwanakazi nguwakabona nguuchisi chipati ujisi bweendelezi kubaami boonse banyika.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa KwaBbabbiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Nikwakayinda eechi ndakabona mungelo uumbi wakazwa kujulu kajisi nguzu mpati, mpawo nyika yakamwinikwa abulemu bwakwe. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Alimwi wakoompolola ajwi pati kati, “Yawa, yawa Bbabbiloni impati! Yabachikkalilo chabasikazwa, achiyubilo chamyuuya yoonse iisofweede, achiyubilo chabayuni boonse basofweede abanyama boonse basofwede mbimusula. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Nkaambo manyika woonse anywa wayini wazisusi zyayo zibi zyamabumambi, bami banyika bakachita bumaambi anjiyo, mpawo abasimakwebo banyika bakaba bavubi ankaambo kabuvubi bwabusindya zyayo.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Eelyo ndakamvwa ijwi limbi kalizwa kujulu kaliti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Nibantu bangu! Amuzwe mulinjiyo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Kuchitila kutI utakabalilizigwi muzibi zyayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kuchitila kuti mutabi akwaabilana muzyumyo zyayo,<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Nkaambo zibi zyayo zyabungikwa mubulamfu bwabwiime zyalampa mbuli julu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">alimwi Leza wayiyeeya milandu yayo,<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />amubwedezye kulinjiyo mbuli mbwamupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">amuliye zyiindulidwe tubili nkaambo kamilimu yayo njiyakachita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">amuswaanizye zyiindulidwe tubili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">muchinywido chayo nchiyakamuswanizizya.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Amuyipenzye akuyichisya moyo kapati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">mbuli mweelo mbwaayakali kulilumbayizya akuba muvubi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Mbukunga mumoyo wayo wamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">‘Ndilikkede achuuno chabwami mbuli namalelo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">tandili mukamufu pe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">tandikwe kuyoolila pe!’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Nkikaako zyumyo zyayo ziyooza kulinjiyo mubuzuba bumwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">bwamalwazi, kulila, abbalangwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">alimwi iyoowumpwa amulilo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">nkaambo Mwami Leza uyibeteka ulaanguzu.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Alimwi bami bamunyika, bakachita mamambi anjiyo akwaabana anjiyo buvubi, bayooyilila akuusa nibayobona busi bwakupya kwayo. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Bayooyimikila kule nkaambo kakuyoowa kupenzegwa kwayo, alimwi bayooti, “Maawe! Maawe! nuchisi chipati, chisi changuzu, Bbabbiloni! Muhola limwi lubeta lwaza.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Alabo basimakwebo banyika bayomulilila akumomokela, nkaambo takwe muntu utakawule limbi makwebo aayo, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />taakwe uyoowula angolide, ansiliva, amabwe mayandisi angale, amangongo mebesi, amudabba wabo muteteete, aawanamoomvwe, mudabba utezemuka, amasani asalala pilibili, amisamu ibezwa yoonse inunkilila, azyameja, amasamu amuulo mupati, azyamukuba, azyalubulo, azyamabweluuma, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />tununkilizyo tutegwa twasinamoni, atununkilizyo, atuumpilizyo, tununkilizyo tulikabotu tutegwa amiri, bwaamwa, wayini, amafuta amu olivu, abusu bunante, abulotwe, iŋombe ambelele, mbongolo ankalaki, abazike, nikuba buumi bwabantu. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Bayooti kulinjiyo, “Muchelo ooyo ngumwakali kuyanda wakazwa kulinduwe, alimwi azyoonse zintu zibotu nzyakali kuyandisya akuŋayimina kwazyo zyoonse zyakaloba, taakwe niziyoojanwa lubo pe!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Basimakwebo bakawuzya zintu eezi, mpawo bakajana buvubi kuzwa kulinjiyo, bayooyimikila kule, kabayoowa kupenzegwa kwayo, bayoolila akoomoka, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />kabati “Maawe, maawe, kuchisi chipati chakalisamikidwe amudabba muteteete, zyadowalowa azisalala pilibili, zibayima angolide, amabwe mayandisi angale! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Muhola limwi buvubi oobu boonse bwaloba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Alimwi boonse bapati babasikweenzya maato, aboonse basikweenda amaato amulwizi, abasikweenzya maato abaabo boonse basimakwebo bakali mulwizi, bayooyimikila kulale, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />mpawo bakalila nibakaboona busi bwakuumpwa kwayo bakati, “Nchiichili chisi chakalikozyene achisi chipati eechi?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Mpawo bakalitutiila suko amitwe yabo, kabalikulilila akoomoka, kaboompolola kabati, “Maawe maawe, kuchisi chipati eecho boonse nkubakalijisi maato mulwizi nkubakaba bavubi alubono lwayo! Muhola limwi chaloba.<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Nkaambo kacheechi amusekelele, nimajulu, nibasalali abatumwa abasinsimi, nkaambo Leza wamubeteka, alubeta ndwakamubeteka!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Eelyo mungelo singuzu wakabweza ibbwe lilimbuli iziyo pati mpawo wakali walila mulwizi, wakati, “Aboobo mbumbubo chiisi chipati Bbabbiloni mbuchiyoowalilwa aansi chabukali, alimwi takwe kuyoojanwa limbi pe. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Mpawo muvuumo wabasituntimbwa awabayimbi, awabasinyeele awabasimyeembo, tabakwe kuyoomvwigwa limbi pe mulinduwe, abasyabusongo bamilimu tabakwe kuyoojanwa limbi pe mulinduwe, amuvuumo waziyo tuukwe kuyoomvwigwa limbi pe mulinduwe, <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />alimwi mumuni wachimwinikisyo tuukwe kuyoomwinika limbi pe kulinduwe ajwi lyanabwiinga asibwiinga talikwe kuyoomvwigwa limbi pe kulinduwe, nkaambo basimakwebo bakali bantu bapati munyika, alimwi manyika woonse akeenwa abulozi bwako.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Alimwi mulinjiyo mwakajanwa bulowa bwabasinsimi abwabasalali, abaabo boonse bakajeegwa anyika.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Nikwakamana eechi ndakamvwa chibaanga ndijwi pati lyankamu mpati mujulu, kalyoompolola kaliti, “Haleluya! Lufutuko abulemu, anguzu nzizya Leza wesu, <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />nkaambo lubeta lwakwe ndwakasimpe alimwi luliluleme, wabeteka simamambi mupati wakanyonganiya nyika amamambi aakwe, alimwi wakabwedezya alinguwe bulowa bwabalanda bakwe.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Alubo bakoompolola kabati, “Haleluya! Busi buzwa kulinguwe bunoosuka kujulu kwalyoonse alyoonse!” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Mpawo baalu balimakumi abili abane azinyama zipona zine bakavuntama alimwi bakakomba Leza ukkede achuuno chabwami, kabati, “Ameni. Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pobwe Lyamakwatani aMwana Wambelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Eelyo kuzwa kuchuuno chabwami kwakazwa ijwi lyoompolola kaliti, “Ngalumbayizigwe Leza wesu, inywe moonse nibalanda bakwe, inywe nimumuyoowa, baniini abapati!” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Ndakamvwa chibaanga ndijwi, chilimbuli muvuumo wameenda mayiingi, awuli mbuli kundindima kwandabi, akoompolola kabati, “Haleluya! Nkaambo Mwami Leza wesu Singuzu Zyoonse nguyendelezya! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ngatusekelele akukondwa akumupa bulemu, nkaambo lukwatano lwaMwana ambelele lwasika, nabwiinga wakwe walibambila kale. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Wakazumizigwa kuti asame mudabba muteteete, uŋayima alimwi utuba bu” (nkaambo mudabba muteteete nguumulimu wabusalali wabasalali.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Mpawo mungelo wakati kulindime, “Lemba eechi: Balaachoolwe aabo batambidwe kupobwe lyalukwatano lyaMwana wambelele.” Alimwi wakati kulindime, “Aaya ngimajwi akasimpe aLeza.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Eelyo ndakawida kumawulu akwe kuti ndimukombe, pesi wakati kulindime, “Tweleede pe kuchita eecho! Nkaambo ndilimulanda ime anduwe abakwesu aabo bajisi bukamboni bwaJesu. Amukombe Leza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Nkaambo bukamboni bwaJesu ngumuuya wabusinsimi.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sikweenzya Wambongolo Ituba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Eelyo ndakabona ijulu kalijulidwe, mpawo laanga, imbongolo ituba! Ooyo sikuyeenzya utegwa Usyomeka aKasimpe, alimwi mubululami ulabeteka akulwana nkondo zyakwe. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Meso aakwe ali mbuli ibangabanga lyamulilo, kumutwe wakwe kulimisini myiingi, alimwi ujisi izina litazibwi naba umwi kunze kwakwe alikke. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Usamide mudabba uchunchidwe mubulowa, alimwi izina ndyayitwa alyo litegwa, “Ndijwi LyaLeza.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Alimwi basilumamba bakujulu, bakasamide mudabba muteteete, utuba bu, bakamutobela ambongolo zituba. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Kuzwa kumulomo wakwe ugwisya panga libosya eelyo ndyajazya manyika, alimwi uyoobeendelezya amufunko walubulo, uyoolyata chikandilo chamasansa mubukali bwaLeza Singuzu Zyoonse. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Amudabba wakwe aachibelo chakwe uli azina lilembedwe kuti, Mwami wabami alimwi Mweendelezi wabeendelezi.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Eelyo ndakabona mungelo kayimvwi muzuba, mpawo wakayita ajwi pati kubayuni boonse aabo bawuluka mumulengalenga kati, “Muze, mubunganine kupobwe pati lyaLeza, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />kuti mulye nyama yabaami, anyama yabapati bankondo, anyama yabantu bapati, anyama yambongolo ayabeenzyi bazyo, anyama yabantu boonse, boonse baangunukide abazike, boonse baniini abapati.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Eelyo ndakabona chinyama, abaami bamunyika, amakamu makamu abasinkondo babo kababungene kuti bachite nkondo atala ayooyo sikuyeenzya abasilumamba bakwe. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Alimwi chinyama chakajatwa, mpawo anchicho amusinsimi mubeji ooyo wakabeleka zitondezyo kunembo lyacho. (Bakeenena aabo bakali batambula impa yachinyama abaabo bakali kukomba chikozyanisyo chacho.) Aaba babili bakawalwa kabali bawumbulu mubbila lyamulilo eelyo lyuumpa amulilo utegwa wasalufa. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Alimwi bamwi boonse bakajeegwa apanga lyayooyo sikuyeenzya mbongolo, ipanga eelyo lyakali kuzwa mumulomo wakwe, mpawo abayuni boonse bakalya bakakkuta mibili yabo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Chuulu Chaminyaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Eelyo ndakabona mungelo kaseluka kuzwa kujulu, kajisi chijuzyo chamulindi utagoli muluboko lwakwe alimwi anketani impati. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />alimwi wakajata simwaaba, ooyo muzoka wakale utegwa Sikuchenga alimwi kali nguSatani, akumwaanga kwaminyaaka iilichuulu, <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />alimwi mungelo wakamuwaalila mumulindi utagoli, wakamujalila mpawo wakajala aajulu, kuchitila kuti atakeeni lubo manyika, mane yakumana eeyo minyaaka iilchuulu. Musule aboobo weelede kwangununwa kwakayiindi kaniini.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Eelyo ndakabona zyuuno zyabwami, bakalikkede mpawo mbaabo bakapegwa nguzu zyakubeteka. Alubo ndakabona myuuya yababo bakagonkwa mitwe yabo nkaambo kakuba bakamboni baJesu alimwi nkaambo kajwi lyaLeza. Aaba mbimbabo ibatakwe bakakomba chinyama nikuba chikozyano chacho akutatambula impa yacho ankumu zyabo nimuba mumaboko abo. Bakabuka kuzwa kubafu, akweendelezya aamwi aKkirisitu kwaminyaka iilichuulu. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />bakachaala kubafu tebakabuka pe mane minyaka iilichuulu niyakamana. Oobu mbuububuke butaanzi. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Uli achoolwe alimwi ulasalala ooyo uyooba akati kabaabo bayoobuka lutaanzi! Atala abaliboobu lufu lwabili talukwe inguzu pe, pesi bayooba bapayizi baLeza abaKkirisitu, mpawo bayooyendelezya aawe kwaminyaka iilichuulu.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzundwa KwaSatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Alimwi munyaka iilichuulu yaakumana, Satani uyoowangununwa kuzwa muntolongo yakwe, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />mpawo uyozwa kuyoyeneena manyika woonse alimuzyooko zine zyanyika, nkukuti, Gogo aMagogo, akwaabunganizya amwi kunkondo, mweelwe wabo ulimbuli muse wakulwizi. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Mpawo bakeenda mubulamfu boonse bwanyika akuzyunguluka busena bwabasalali achisi chiyandika, pesi mulilo wakaseluka kuzwa kujulu, wakabanyonyoona, <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />alimwi Sikuchenga ooyo wakali wabachenga wakawalilwa mubbila lyamulilo asalufa oko chinyama, amusinsimi mubeji nkubakali bede, mpawo bayoopenzegwa isikati amasiku kwalyoonse alyoonse.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubeta Lwakumamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Eelyo ndakabona chuuno chipati chabwami chituba ayooyo wakalikkede alinchicho, ijulu anyika zyakachija kuzwa kubusyu bwakwe, alimwi taakwe busena bwabo bwakajanwa. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Mpawo ndakabona bafu, bapati abaniini, kabayiimvwi kunembo lyachuuno chabwami, mpawo mabbuku akavununwa. Alubo lwakavununwa ibbuku limbi, ndiibbuku lyabuumi. Mpawo bafu bakabetekwa azeezyo nzibakachita, mbuli zyakalilembedwe mumabbuku. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Alimwi lwizi lwakaselula bakali mulindulo, lufu bafu achikkalilo chabafu zyakaselula bafu bakali mulinzizyo, alimwi boonse bakabetekwa mbuli eezyo nzibakachita. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Eelyo lufu achikkalilo chabafu zyakawaalilwa mubbila lyamulilo. Eeli ibbila lyamulilo nduulufu lwachibili. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Naakuti izina lyawumwi lyaleka kujanika kalilembedwe mubbuku lyabuumi, wakali kuwaalilwa mubbila lyamulilo.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Ijulu Ipya Anyika Impya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Eelyo ndakabona ijulu pya anyika mpya, nkaambo julu taanzi anyika ntaanzi zyakayinda, alimwi lwizi teelwakachiliwo pe. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Alimwi ndakabona chisi chisalala, Jerusalemu mupya, kuuseluka kuzwa kujulu kuli Leza, wasakatizigwa mbuli nabwiinga mbwasamina mulumi wakwe. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Alimwi ndakamvwa ijwi ipati lizwa kuchuuno chabwami kaliti, “Laanga, bukkalo bwaLeza buli kubantu. Uyookkala ambabo, alimwi bayooba bantu bakwe, alakwe Leza lwakwe uyooba ambabo, alimwi uyooba Leza wabo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Uyoosinda misozi yoonse kumeso aabo. Takukwe kuyooba lufu limbi pe, takukwe kuyooba mawuse nikuba koomoka nikuba machise limbi pe, nkaambo zintu zyoonse zyachiindi zinooli zyayinda.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Mpawo ooyo ukkede achuuno chabwami wakati, “Laanga, ndiliikuchita zintu zyoonse kuba zipya.” Alimwi wakati, “Lemba eechi, nkaambo majwi aaya alasyomeka alimwi ngakasimpe.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Eelyo wakati kulindime, “Zyachitika! Ndime Alufa aOmega, matalikilo amamanino. Kuli ooyo ulaanyota ndiyoomupa meenda abuumi azwa kukasensa katakwe muulo. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Ooyo uzunda uyojana lukono oolu, alimwi ndiyooba Leza wakwe mpawo uyooba mwana wangu mulombe. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Pesi kubantu bayoofu, batasyomi, bachita zisesemya, bajeyi, basibwaamu, balozi, bakomba mituni, aboonse babeja busena bwabo buyooba mubbila lyamulilo lyuumpa amulilo utegwa ulasalufa, oolu nduulufu lwachibili.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalemu Mupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Eelyo kwakasika umwi wabaangelo balimusanu ababili bakali andido zilimusanu azibili zyakalizwide zyuumyo zyakumamanino zilimusanu azibili, mpawo wakaambuula andime kati, “Kuza, ndiyookutondeezya Nabwiinga, mwanakazi waMwana wambelele.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Alimwi muMuuya wakanditola kuchilundu chipati kachili chilamfu, mpawo wakanditondeezya chisi chisalala chitegwa Jerusalemu kachizwa kujulu kuli Leza, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />kachijisi bulemu bwaLeza, kuŋayima kwacho kwakali mbuli ibbwe liyandisi, mbuli ibbwe litegwa jasipa, libalangala mbuli kkirasitali. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Chakalijisi bulambo bupati kabuli bulamfu, chakali amilyango iliikkumi ayibili, akumilyango kwakali baangelo balikkumi ababili, alimwi amilyango kwakalilembedwe mazina amikowa yabana baIzirayeli balikkumi ababili. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kwakali milyango itaatu kujwe, kunyika milyango itaatu, kumusanza milyango itaatu, alimwi kumbo milyango itaatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Alimwi bulambo bwachisi bwakalijisi ntalisyo zilikkumi azibili, mpawo alinzizyo kwakali mazina abatumwa balikkumi ababili baMwana wambelele. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Mungelo ooyo wakaambuula andime wakalijisi cheelesyo changolide wakweela chisi amilyango yawo abulambo. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Chisi chakaliyakidwe azyooko zine, bulamfu kabweelene abusasa, mpawo wakeela chisi akalamu, wajana intaamo zyakali kwamba kuba chuulu chiindulwidwe azyuulu zibili amyaanda iine, bulamfu bwacho, busasa, abwiime, kazyeelene. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Mpawo mungelo wakeela bulambo mukweela kwamuntu, wakajana ntaamo zilimbuli makumi musanu akkumi limwi antaamo zilimusanu. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Bulambo bwakaliyakidwe amabwe ategwa aJasipa, anukuti chisi chakali changolide yanchoonzyo, yakali kubalangala mbuli ibbwe libalangala. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Intalisyo yabulaambo bwachisi bwakalisakatide amabwe mayandisi woonse, itaanzi lyakali kutegwa Jasipa lyakali lyamuntondo, lyachibili lyakalikutegwa safiro wakali mbuli sikkaka, lyachitatu lyakali kutegwa kkalikedoni lyakali amabalamabala, alyachine lyakali kutegwa emeraludi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />lyachisanu lyakali kutegwa Onikkisi, lyachisanu alimwi lyakalikutegwa Kkaneliya, lyachisanu aayibili lyakali kutegwa Kkirisolayiti lya chisanu ayitatu lyakali kutegwa bbereli, lyachisanu atune lyakali tegwa Topazi, lyakkumi lyakali kutegwa Kkirisoperize, lyakkumi alimwi litegwa Jasiniti, lyakkumi aabili lyakali kutegwa Ametisiti. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Alimwi milyango ilikkumi ayiibili njangale mbuli maŋoŋo zilikkumi azibili, umwi awumwi mulyango ngwangale imwi, anzila mpati yachisi njangolida yachoonzyo ibalangala mbuli ibbwe libalangala.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Alimwi teendakabona ŋanda yaLeza pe muchisi, nkaambo ŋanda yawo nguMwami Leza Singuzu Zyoonse aMwana wambelele. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Mpawo chisi tachiyandi zuba nikuba mweezi pe kuti uchimwinikile, nkaambo bulemu bwaLeza ngumumuni wacho, alimwi chimwinikisyo lyacho nguMwana wambelele. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Amumuni wacho manyika ayooyenda, abaami bamunyika bayooyeta bulemu bwabo mulinchicho, <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />amilyango yacho tikoyoojalwa pe sikati, alimwi takukwe kuyooba mansiku pe nkuko, <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />bayooyeta kulinchicho bulemu alulemeko lwamanyika. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Taakwe pe chisofwede chiyoonjila mumo, nikuba umwi uchita zisesemya nikuba zyakubeja, pesi luzutu aabo balembedwe mubbuku lyabuumi lyaMwana wambelele.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Eelyo mungelo wakanditondezya mulonga wameenda abuumi, abalangala mbuli ibbwe litegwa Kkirasitali, uyenda kuuzwa kuchuuno chaLeza achaMwana wambelele, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />kuuyinda akati kakazila kachisi. Kulubazu lumwi alumwi lwamulonga kwakalimenede musamu wabuumi, ulaamisyobo yamichelo ilikkumi ayibili, izyala michelo yaayo myeezi yoonse, alimwi matu aayo akali akusilika manyika. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Takukoyooba chimbi chitukidwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Pesi chuuno chabwami bwaLeza achaMwana wambelele chiyooba mumo, alimwi balanda bakwe bayoomukomba, <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />bayoobona busyu bwakwe, alimwi izina lyakwe linoli ankumu zyabo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Takukwe kuyooba limbi mansiku, takuyandi kumwinikilwa achimwinikizyo pe nikuba chazuba, nkaambo Mwami Leza nguyooba mumuni wabo, alimwi bayooyendelezya kwalyoonse alyoonse.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuboola KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Alimwi mungelo wakati kulindime, “Majwi aaya alasyomeka mpawo ngakasimpe. Mpawo Mwami, Leza wamyuuya yabasinsimi, watuma mungelo wakwe kuzootondezya balanda bakwe zintu zyeelede kuba achakufwambana.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Alimwi amulange, ndilaza akufwambana. Ulaachoolwe ooyo ubamba majwi achisinsimi chabbuku eeli!”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ime Joni ndime ndakamvwa akubona zintu eezi. Alimwi nindakamvwa akuzibona, ndakawida aansi amawulu amungelo kuti ndimukombe ooyo wakazitondeezya kulindime, <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />pesi wakati kulindime, “Tweelede kuchita oobo pe! Ndilimulanda ime anduwe ababunyina basinsimi, aabo babamba majwi abbuku eeli. Komba Leza.” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Alimwi wakati kulindime, “Utabambi kilinsiswa majwi achisinsimi chabbuku eeli, nkaambo chiindi chaba afwiifwi kuti choonse eechi chikakuchitike. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />kufumbwa uchita bubi kachita bubi, kufumbwa uchita busofwazi kachita busofwazi, kufumbwa ululeme kapona mubululami, kufumbwa usalala kapona mubusalali.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Langa, ndilaza achakufwambana! Kandeeta bulumbu bwangu, bwakuliya woonse mukwiinda mumilimu yakwe njakalikuchita. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ndime Alufa aOmega, mutaanzi amamanino, matalikilo amagolelo.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Balaachoolwe aabo basapa midabba yabo, kuti bakabe acheelelo kumusamu wabuumi akuti bakanjile amilyango yachisi. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Pesi anze achisi kuli bankala abalozi abasimamambi abajayi abasikukomba mituni, awoonse uyandisya akuchita zyakubeja.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Ime ndiJesu ndakatuma mungelo wangu kulindinywe kuti akamupe bukamboni oobu kumbungano. Ndime chisyuukilwa alunyungu lwaDevidi, ntanda imwekesya.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Muuya anabwiinga bati, “Kuza!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Alimwi amuleke umvwa aambe kuti, “Kuza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Alimwi amuleke ulaanyota aze, amuleke ooyo uyanda anywe maanzi abuumi atakwe muulo.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumeelelezyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ime, ndichenjezya muntu woonse umvwa majwi aaya abusinsimi bwabbuku eeli, naa umwi wayungizya kulingawo, Leza uyooyungizya kulinguwe zyuumyo zyakaambwa mubbuku eeli. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Alimwi kuti umwi wagwisya majwi azwa kubbuku eeli lyabusinsimi oobu, Leza uyoogwisya chaabilo chakwe kumusamu wabuumi achamuchisi chisalala, aayo akaambwa mubbuku eeli.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Ooyo upa bukamboni atala azintu eezi kaamba kuti, “Nichoonzyo ndiliikuza chakufwambana!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Ameni. Kuza, Mwami Jesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Luzyalo lwaMwami Jesu lube abantu boonse.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>